---
title: TumbleBuff
hidden: false
---
**Tumblebuff**&nbsp;is a glitch which allows the player to buff weapons which you normally can't buff with sorceries, miracles or resins.

## External resources

Tutorial with spells / miracles [https://youtu.be/gHa69W9Yjlc](https://youtu.be/gHa69W9Yjlc) by Delyssiya on YouTube.  *This method was found by* [*Eloise*](https://www.youtube.com/@eloelo__) *in january 2025.*

---

